  "date": "NO LA RECUERDO",
  "content": "I had been feeling dizzy for two days before I had an out of body experience in my home. I could observe how I was dressed. I had already had a severe asthma attack, and then I felt dizzy at about 7 pm. I was taken to the clinic, and I stayed like that for 30 minutes. The doctor checked me. He said I was dead and that they should take me to the morgue to do the autopsy required by law. My husband asked the doctor not to send me there, to check me, stay close and let me stay in observation to see if I responded to any movement. The doctor agreed, thank goodness, and, yes, I came back 30 minutes later. After this, they took me home, and I slept until the next day.",
